   "ENFORCED": "a complete enumeration of the DIRECT writers in this repository: a write whose target is a name bound to the path. Proof about the code that EXISTS, never about code that could be written, and it does not see a write through a helper that takes the path as an argument. That is why it is a separate word from PROVEN.",
