  "why_no_smt": "the properties decidable here are decidable by exhaustion over spaces of tens of elements; an SMT encoding of a 49-edge graph would add a dependency, a translation layer and a second place for the model to disagree with the code, and would prove the same thing. The ones that are NOT decidable here are statements about future code, and no solver settles those.",
